<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: giant capacitor array -->
  <DNX_GiantCapacitorArray.label>巨型电容阵列</DNX_GiantCapacitorArray.label>
  <!-- EN: A massive capacitor array for high-energy defensive weapons. It stores a huge amount of power like a battery and can discharge into linked DNX heavy energy weapons anywhere on the same map. <color=yellow><b>Your energy weapons must rely on this large, stable energy-storage device to provide the power they need to operate.</b></color> -->
  <DNX_GiantCapacitorArray.description>供高能防御武器使用的大型电容阵列。它像电池一样储存大量电力，并可向同一地图内任意位置的联动DNX重型能量武器放电。&lt;color=yellow&gt;&lt;b&gt;你的能量武器必须依赖这种大型、稳定的储能装置来提供能量工作。&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/color&gt;</DNX_GiantCapacitorArray.description>
  
</LanguageData>
